<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Linux - 标签 - 春和景明-Spaceack's Blog</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/tags/linux/</link><description>Linux - 标签 - 春和景明-Spaceack's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</managingEditor><webMaster>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</webMaster><copyright>This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 21:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://spaceack.github.io/tags/linux/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Linux命令行参数的总长度的上限值探究</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20240905%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%A1%8C%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%80%BB%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%E5%80%BC%E6%8E%A2%E7%A9%B6/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20240905%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%A1%8C%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%80%BB%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%E5%80%BC%E6%8E%A2%E7%A9%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p>对于 Linux bash 参数过长错误 “Argument list too long” 网上有很多解决方案，但并没有解释这个最大长度的值的范围。本着追根溯源的态度，本文对此问题做一个探究。记录下限制参数长度的因素以及最大长度。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Linux下检测某个ip端口的连通状态</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20210121-linux%E4%B8%8B%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AAip%E7%AB%AF%E5%8F%A3%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9E%E9%80%9A%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 Jan 2021 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20210121-linux%E4%B8%8B%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AAip%E7%AB%AF%E5%8F%A3%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9E%E9%80%9A%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>举个例子，要测试的 ip+port: 192.168.0.100:8080</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>使用 <code>telnet</code> 命令</p>
<p><code>telnet 192.168.0.100 8080</code></p>
<p>连通成功：</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
